  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "14466312",
      "title": "Improving the Reactive Service with Observables (Subjects)",
      "lectureOrder": 505,
      "videoOrder": 463,
      "sourceHash": "e170355a9c727bf96d5543b440e7ba2612a3d894ce09e57759fdedbf70260198",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.4,
          "end": 5.28,
          "en": "Instructor: Let's now use our newly gained knowledge",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.28,
          "end": 8.61,
          "en": "about observables in our recipe book",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.61,
          "end": 10.59,
          "en": "in our course project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.59,
          "end": 13.68,
          "en": "Thus far in there, we are already using a pattern,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.68,
          "end": 15.843,
          "en": "which you just learned in the last section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.843,
          "end": 17.4,
          "en": "that you shouldn't use,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.4,
          "end": 20.94,
          "en": "or that can be replaced with a better pattern.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.94,
          "end": 23.88,
          "en": "And that better pattern is, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.88,
          "end": 27.63,
          "en": "to replace all our event emitters which we have,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.63,
          "end": 29.4,
          "en": "with subjects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.4,
          "end": 31.47,
          "en": "So for example, here in the shopping list service",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.47,
          "end": 32.82,
          "en": "we have that event emitter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.82,
          "end": 36.18,
          "en": "which we already use to push new information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.18,
          "end": 40.26,
          "en": "about changed ingredients from component A to B.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.26,
          "end": 43.533,
          "en": "Well, we'll now change this to a subject instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.91,
          "end": 46.717,
          "en": "One tiny thing I also noticed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.717,
          "end": 49.89,
          "en": "is that here in the app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.89,
          "end": 52.156,
          "en": "we of course, no longer need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.156,
          "end": 55.26,
          "en": "the on navigate function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.26,
          "end": 57.03,
          "en": "and therefore also not here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.03,
          "end": 60.72,
          "en": "this function handler, but that's a minor thing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.72,
          "end": 64.11,
          "en": "Let's instead focus on the shopping list now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.11,
          "end": 67.29,
          "en": "and there in the shopping list service,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.29,
          "end": 71.31,
          "en": "I want to set up my subject.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.31,
          "end": 76.31,
          "en": "So for that, I will first of all add a new import up there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.03999999999999,
          "end": 81.27,
          "en": "and I will import subject from RxJS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.27,
          "end": 84.39,
          "en": "just as you learned it in the observables section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.39,
          "end": 87.09,
          "en": "You can now simply replace event emitter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.09,
          "end": 91.59,
          "en": "with subject here because it works almost in the same way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.59,
          "end": 93.6,
          "en": "That of course means that we can get rid of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.6,
          "end": 95.7,
          "en": "that event emitter import up there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.7,
          "end": 98.46000000000001,
          "en": "And now there's one thing we need to fix, though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.46000000000001,
          "end": 103.46000000000001,
          "en": "Whenever we call emit, we now have to call next instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.56,
          "end": 108.56,
          "en": "because subjects use next to emit or send a new value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.31,
          "end": 114,
          "en": "Now, the parts where we consume ingredients changed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114,
          "end": 117.393,
          "en": "however, these parts don't need to change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.06,
          "end": 123.9,
          "en": "So here, in the shopping list component where we subscribe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.9,
          "end": 128.13,
          "en": "to the ingredients changed event emitter previously,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 128.13,
          "end": 131.94,
          "en": "we now subscribe to the subject and that is absolutely fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 131.94,
          "end": 134.79,
          "en": "It has the same syntax regarding that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 134.79,
          "end": 137.31,
          "en": "However, there is one thing we do need to change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 137.31,
          "end": 140.07,
          "en": "We don't need to change that syntax, but as you learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 140.07,
          "end": 143.7,
          "en": "it is a good and recommended practice to store that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.7,
          "end": 146.61,
          "en": "subscription in some property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 146.61,
          "end": 149.25,
          "en": "and clean it up when we leave the component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 149.25,
          "end": 153.27,
          "en": "So, I'll add a private property ig change sub",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 153.27,
          "end": 154.71,
          "en": "or whatever you wanna name it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 154.71,
          "end": 156.96,
          "en": "which is of type subscription.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 156.96,
          "end": 161.96,
          "en": "And you therefore need to import subscription from RxJS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.97,
          "end": 163.59,
          "en": "at the top of your file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.59,
          "end": 167.4,
          "en": "Now with that changed, of course it's not enough to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 167.4,
          "end": 168.36,
          "en": "create a property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 168.36,
          "end": 171.99,
          "en": "I really wanna store my subscription in that property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 171.99,
          "end": 175.32,
          "en": "So, I'll set this ig change sub equal to this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 175.32,
          "end": 176.94,
          "en": "sl service ingredients changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.94,
          "end": 180.21,
          "en": "Subscribe because subscribe returns a subscription,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 180.21,
          "end": 181.59,
          "en": "which we store in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 181.59,
          "end": 184.243,
          "en": "And now to clear it, whenever we leave that component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 184.243,
          "end": 188.34,
          "en": "let's add on destroy as an interface",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 188.34,
          "end": 191.19,
          "en": "which you also import from at Angular Core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 191.19,
          "end": 195.69,
          "en": "That forces us to add ng on destroy here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 195.69,
          "end": 199.07999999999998,
          "en": "And in ng on destroy, we can now use our sub,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 199.07999999999998,
          "end": 204,
          "en": "our ig change sub property, to unsubscribe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 204,
          "end": 206.25,
          "en": "And this now, is the recommended pattern",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 206.25,
          "end": 208.47,
          "en": "which will replace the event emitter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 208.47,
          "end": 210.87,
          "en": "with a more optimal solution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 210.87,
          "end": 214.59,
          "en": "Now, we're using a similar pattern in the recipes area.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 214.59,
          "end": 216.51,
          "en": "If we have a look at the recipes service,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 216.51,
          "end": 218.76,
          "en": "there we have the recipe selected property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 218.76,
          "end": 220.41,
          "en": "which is also an event emitter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 220.41,
          "end": 224.25,
          "en": "And the offer, since this is also not decorated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 224.25,
          "end": 226.23,
          "en": "with output and not part of a component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 226.23,
          "end": 228.51,
          "en": "which would be a totally different use case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 228.51,
          "end": 229.95,
          "en": "So since, we instead used it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 229.95,
          "end": 233.19,
          "en": "for a cross component communication through a service,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 233.19,
          "end": 236.31,
          "en": "we should replace this with a subject, as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 236.31,
          "end": 239.85,
          "en": "So, let's replace event emitter with subject here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 239.85,
          "end": 243.39,
          "en": "and therefore we can get rid of event emitter up there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 243.39,
          "end": 244.62,
          "en": "And of course, now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 244.62,
          "end": 248.37,
          "en": "however, we have to import that subject here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 248.37,
          "end": 252.69,
          "en": "So, let's import subject from RxJS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 252.69,
          "end": 256.68,
          "en": "And now, make sure that wherever you are emitting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 256.68,
          "end": 261,
          "en": "a new value, you now use next instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 261,
          "end": 263.3,
          "en": "We're still setting up a subscription to it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 263.3,
          "end": 265.47,
          "en": "in the recipes component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 265.47,
          "end": 268.71,
          "en": "but that was done to have a solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 268.71,
          "end": 272.97,
          "en": "for loading different recipes, before we added routing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 272.97,
          "end": 276.65999999999997,
          "en": "Now with routing added, we actually don't need this anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 276.65999999999997,
          "end": 279.001,
          "en": "because now when we want to select a recipe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 279.001,
          "end": 281.19,
          "en": "well, then we do this by clicking on it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 281.19,
          "end": 283.5,
          "en": "and we use the route link directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 283.5,
          "end": 285.57,
          "en": "here in our recipe item component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 285.57,
          "end": 287.79,
          "en": "to load different recipes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 287.79,
          "end": 290.31,
          "en": "So instead, here, we can actually get rid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 290.31,
          "end": 292.2,
          "en": "of recipes selected in total,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 292.2,
          "end": 294.51,
          "en": "but if you would use it as we did before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 294.51,
          "end": 297.42,
          "en": "so where we would use that to select different recipes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 297.42,
          "end": 299.823,
          "en": "you would use it as a subject.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 301.98,
          "end": 303.87,
          "en": "In our case, as I just mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 303.87,
          "end": 306.84,
          "en": "we can simply get rid of the usage of it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 306.84,
          "end": 309.78,
          "en": "and therefore, also of the injection of recipe service",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 309.78,
          "end": 314.78,
          "en": "here in our recipes component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 314.88,
          "end": 317.49,
          "en": "And we can also get rid of the recipe model here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 317.49,
          "end": 321.57,
          "en": "And with that all cleaned up, we're now using the subject",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 321.57,
          "end": 323.22,
          "en": "in one place, in a shopping list area,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 323.22,
          "end": 326.01,
          "en": "not in a recipes area because there we have no use case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 326.01,
          "end": 327.42,
          "en": "for it right now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 327.42,
          "end": 329.82,
          "en": "With that, our application looks good",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 329.82,
          "end": 333.246,
          "en": "and works just like it did before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 333.246,
          "end": 335.76,
          "en": "at least as far as we can go.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 335.76,
          "end": 339.03,
          "en": "And now we're using a subject instead of an event emitter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 339.03,
          "end": 341.4,
          "en": "The other parts you'll learn about observables",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 341.4,
          "end": 343.95,
          "en": "what they do, how they work it behind the scenes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 343.95,
          "end": 345.48,
          "en": "that they can throw errors,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 345.48,
          "end": 347.25,
          "en": "and that you can use operators,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 347.25,
          "end": 349.95,
          "en": "will become a bit more important later in the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 349.95,
          "end": 352.74,
          "en": "But now, already, it should be a bit clearer what",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 352.74,
          "end": 355.35,
          "en": "this routing params thing is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 355.35,
          "end": 358.32,
          "en": "and well, how we can conveniently pass data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 358.32,
          "end": 361.983,
          "en": "from A to B in the best possible way by using subjects.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
